                                                "sense_id": "80dc127e-ed48-38d0-86f5-d8289ed5cfc1",
                                                "text": "He followed the steps of Bella, who soon conducted him to his chamber, and left him to those ablutions which a long ride along a sandy road had rendered particularly necessary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "128140d7-c035-481a-b164-4e54d040eb14",
                                                "sense_id": "80dc127e-ed48-38d0-86f5-d8289ed5cfc1",
                                                "text": "She treats him not as a doddering old fool but as a man hampered in his movements by injury. Patiently, without baby-talk, she helps him through his ablutions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfb10ef2-2840-42e2-a91c-c6da7d84b19d",
                                                "sense_id": "80dc127e-ed48-38d0-86f5-d8289ed5cfc1",
                                                "text": "There are now indications that it has caused some Americans to become more spartan when it comes to ablutions."
                                            }
